{{also|Vogel}}
==Dutch==

===Alternative forms===
* [[veugel]] (obsolete)

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|odt|nl}} *''fugal'', *''fogal'', from {{proto|Germanic|fuglaz|lang=nl}}. Cognate with English: ''[[fowl]]'', Swedish: ''[[fågel]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Nl-vogel.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|pl1=vogels|pl2=vogelen|dim1=vogeltje|dim2=vogelken|dim3=vogelijn|g=m}}

# A [[bird]], feathered animal
# A [[gaai]], a [[feathered]] target in [[archery]] or [[shooting]]
# {{figuratively}} A [[dude]]

